 dodging and intense concentration on the present moment, we hope you will enter a state of flow, and emerge out of the game in a refreshed state.\n\nTo live life is to keep exposing yourself to stress; how would you confront them?\n\nLearning the way how is an important lesson for all of us.\n\nThe saints from the past have left us the Noble Eightfold Path: the eight ways to live a life of happiness.\n\nWith this game, you shall trace down those paths.", "short_description": "ZEN SPLASH is a stylized game inspired by the concept of Zen."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://rhinoceros-horn.com/top/privacy_policy_en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.facebook.com/zensplashvr/", "publisher_name": "RhinocerosHorn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://rhinoceros-horn.com/top/zen-splash-vr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "CASUAL", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["ja", "en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "465840925000709"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386179_691997234283486_176322963_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=myO1bD27NiMQ7kNvwFmp0SP&_nc_oc=AdryhZzjK-pqvAp5L_sbowethweBJB29NYc8i-uXfo0Vu03FVXEyXyUT4rvg79sTzSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af31AQIB9mTRnf67gdwRp7bXXHfRs_63s6baq1PfmrDYcw&oe=69F61550"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_